	"VersionName": "1.3.0",
	"FriendlyName": "Combo Blueprint MCP",
	"Description": "ComboMCP: reads Unreal assets, animations and PIE runtime state into offline-parseable T3D caches for external MCP clients (DSH, Claude Desktop, Cursor, ...). Covers blueprints AND materials, material instances, textures, static/skeletal meshes and levels; exports blueprint graphs, montage timing and AnimBP state machines; can drive PIE play, level load/new/save and read editor logs (write actions are opt-in via COMBO_ALLOW_ACTIONS=1). Verified on UE 5.6.1 and 5.7.4. Needs no compilation.",
